invariant: INV-33
file: webpki_pin.c
catches: webpki_auth_test
reason: read_whole_spki accepts bytes after the SubjectPublicKeyInfo
  inside the raw entry, so the key the reader decoded is not the whole of
  the bytes the pin hashes, and two entries name one key.
  bin/webpki_auth_test's row with one byte after the key, refused with
  unsupported_certificate, objects.

--- old
    return webpki_read_spki(&r, key) && !r.err && rb_left(&r) == 0;
--- new
    return webpki_read_spki(&r, key) && !r.err;
